<h2>Step 1: Set Your Budget and Priorities</h2>
<p>In Metro Vancouver, a typical [bathroom renovation costs](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/) between $15,000 and $45,000 depending on scope, materials, and size.</p>
