<ul>
<li><strong>Tub-to-shower conversion:</strong> Frees up floor space and modernizes the look</li>
<li><strong>Double vanity:</strong> Essential for shared bathrooms, needs at least 60" of wall space</li>
<li><strong>Floating vanity:</strong> Creates a spacious feel and makes floor cleaning easier</li>
<li><strong>Curbless shower:</strong> Accessible, modern, and increasingly popular in Vancouver homes</li>
</ul>
