oom by installing a custom quartz countertop, LED lighting, and black fixtures, ensuring all plumbing and electrical work was up to code. Our [Critical Load Panel Installation](/en/services/critical-load-panel/) service upgrades your home electrical capacity for modern renovation demands.</p><h3>Kitchen Renovation Solution</h3><p>In the kitchen, we used high-quality quartz countertops and a stylish backsplash to create a modern look. The layout was optimized for better flow, making the kitchen both beautiful and practical.</p><h2>Before & After</h2><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-1-mmzneqdl.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - Before 1"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-1-mmzneqdl.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - After 1"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-2-mmzneqdm.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - Before 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mmzneqdm.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - After 2"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mmzneqdm.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - Before 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mmzneqdn.jpg" alt="Coquitlam Condo Bathroom Renovation - After 3"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-1-mmzneqdn.jpg" alt="Kitchen Renovation for Selling Home - Before 1"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-1-mmzneqdo.jpg" alt="Kitchen Renovation for Selling Home - After 1"></div><h2>Results & Key Takeaways</h2><p>The renovation was a resounding success, transforming the condo into a modern, appealing space that stands out in the Coquitlam real estate market. The homeowners were thrilled with the results, noting the increased interest from potential buyers. This project highlights the importance of strategic renovations in enhancing property value and marketability.</p>



