A master ensuite renovation for pre-sale in White Rock costs $20,000–$38,000 and adds $32,000–$60,000 in value — a return of 155–165%. White Rock and South Surrey have a significant retirement and downsizing buyer segment alongside the family market; both demographics place a premium on a renovated, move-in-ready ensuite. Using coastal-appropriate materials — frameless glass (not metal-framed), solid wood or thermofoil vanity — further increases perceived quality and longevity.



