### What specific features and finishes were installed in this Vancouver Skin Lab renovation?
This Vancouver Skin Lab renovation installed custom cabinetry throughout the treatment and reception areas, providing storage and workflow solutions tailored to an aesthetics clinic environment. LED mirrors were installed in treatment rooms — providing precise, even lighting that is critical for skin analysis and treatment procedures. Gray tiles were used throughout on walls and floors, creating a clean, clinical aesthetic consistent with a high-end medical aesthetics brand. The project also required full demolition of existing surfaces and wall modifications to achieve the new floor plan. Total project budget: $345,000–$360,000.


