- [Halaga sa Banyo Renovation Vancouver](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/) — average $10K–$60K+
- [Halaga sa Pagkukumpuni ng Basement Vancouver](/en/guides/basement-renovation-cost-vancouver/) — average $20K–$80K
- [Halaga sa Pagkukumpuni ng Buong Bahay Vancouver](/en/guides/whole-house-renovation-cost-vancouver/) — average $50K–$300K+
