    <tr><td>Subcontractors</td><td>Confirm all subs are covered by contractor''s policy</td><td>Same standards as primary contractor</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Red Flags: Signs a Contractor May Be Uninsured or Unregistered</h2>

<ul>
