UPDATE blog_posts SET content_en = '# Pre-Sale Renovation Maple Ridge BC 2026: Maximize Your Home Value Before Listing

Maple Ridge offers some of the most cost-effective pre-sale renovation opportunities in Metro Vancouver. Larger lots, older housing stock, and lower permit fees create a market where targeted renovations consistently deliver strong returns — and where move-in-ready homes stand out sharply from the competition.

This guide covers the top ROI renovation projects for Maple Ridge sellers in 2026, with neighbourhood-specific strategy for Silver Valley, Albion, Haney, Cottonwood, and Thornhill.

## Why Pre-Sale Renovation Delivers Strong Returns in Maple Ridge

Maple Ridge buyers tend to be practical — they know the renovation costs and price outdated properties accordingly, often over-discounting. A kitchen with dated oak cabinets and laminate countertops in a $900K–$1.4M Albion home isn''t a cosmetic issue to a buyer; it''s a $40K–$70K mental renovation they''re subtracting from their offer.

Strategic pre-sale renovation captures that discount before it becomes your problem.

## Maple Ridge Pre-Sale ROI by Project (2026)

| Project | Cost | Value Added | ROI |
