| Full kitchen renovation | $22,000–$50,000 | $40,000–$85,000 | 160–175% |
| Primary bathroom renovation | $15,000–$28,000 | $28,000–$50,000 | 155–175% |
| Main bathroom modernization | $8,000–$16,000 | $14,000–$28,000 | 145–165% |
| Basement finishing (rec room) | $30,000–$45,000 | $50,000–$80,000 | 155–175% |
| Legal basement suite | $55,000–$95,000 | $90,000–$160,000 | 160–180% |
| LVP flooring throughout | $6,000–$14,000 | $10,000–$22,000 | 145–155% |
