### What was the budget and timeline for this Vancouver skin lab renovation?
This Vancouver skin lab renovation carried a project budget of $345,000–$360,000 and required 4–5 months of active construction — significantly larger in scope than a typical residential renovation due to commercial-grade systems, regulatory compliance requirements, and specialist finishes throughout. The budget covered custom cabinetry, precision-optimized treatment room lighting, a fully tiled accessible restroom meeting BC accessibility standards, and all permit-required commercial occupancy work. Aesthetics clinic renovations at this scale require a contractor experienced with both the technical requirements and the scheduling demands of a business that needs continuity of operations during construction.


