## [Kitchen Renovation](/en/services/kitchen/) | [Cabinet Refinishing](/en/services/cabinet/) Cost in Vancouver 2026

Kitchen renovations are the most popular home improvement project in Metro Vancouver, and pricing varies significantly based on scope:

| Level | What You Get | Price Range |
