### What specific work was included in this Coquitlam whole home renovation?
This Coquitlam home renovation was completed within a $24,000–$26,000 budget over 6–8 weeks, covering three scope areas: floor renovations throughout the home (new flooring that updated the dated interior into a modern space), complete wall painting in a fresh colour scheme, and retaining a feature wallpaper in the bedrooms as a design accent. The feature wallpaper decision — keeping one statement element while updating everything else — is a cost-effective approach that adds personality to a renovation without the budget of custom millwork or architectural changes. The combined flooring-and-paint scope is the most budget-efficient path to a dramatically refreshed home interior.


