### What are current HELOC interest rates for renovation financing in BC in 2026?

In BC in 2026, HELOC interest rates are priced at prime rate plus a lender-specific margin. Major chartered banks offer HELOCs at prime + 0.5% to prime + 1.0%. Credit unions (Vancity, Coast Capital, First West) offer competitive rates at prime + 0.25% to prime + 0.75%. At current prime rates (6.95% as of mid-2026), typical HELOC rates for renovation financing run 7.2%–8.0% for borrowers with good credit and 65%+ LTV. Unlike a mortgage, HELOCs are revolving — you draw what you need, when you need it, and only pay interest on what you''ve drawn. This makes them well-suited for staged renovations where you draw down over a 3–12 month construction timeline.

