## West Vancouver Building Permits

**District of West Vancouver Planning and Development:**
- Address: 750 17th Street, West Vancouver, BC V7V 3T3
- Phone: 604-925-7055
- Online: westvancouver.ca/permits

**Permit required:**
- Any structural changes (removing/adding walls, adding skylights)
- Plumbing relocation
- Electrical panel upgrade
- Deck addition or significant expansion
- Any work affecting building envelope

**No permit required:**
- Interior painting
- Flooring replacement
- Cabinet replacement (same location)
- Countertop swap (no plumbing move)
- Fixture replacement (same location)

**Typical processing time:** 2–4 weeks for minor residential renovation permits; 6–12 weeks for structural or envelope work. Start permits early — West Van review timelines can be longer than neighbouring municipalities.

**Heritage overlay:** Several Ambleside and Dundarave properties are within Heritage Conservation Areas. Any exterior changes require additional review. Confirm your property''s heritage status before planning exterior renovations.

