## Listing Timing: West Vancouver Market Dynamics

**Spring (March–May):** West Vancouver''s primary selling season. Inventory rises but so does buyer activity. Chinese New Year (late Jan/early Feb) starts the spring buying cycle; list in late February or March to capture post-CNY buyers who are pre-approved and motivated.

**Fall (September–October):** Secondary season. Lower inventory than spring often benefits sellers. Trophy properties do particularly well in fall when natural foliage framing views is at its peak.

**Summer:** Mid-market West Van moves slowly in July–August. Trophy properties can sell in summer when target buyers are in Vancouver.

