### What is the complete scope of work in a full Vancouver kitchen renovation?
This Vancouver kitchen renovation covered the complete range of services required for a kitchen transformation: prefab and customized cabinet installation with finger pull design, space planning, cabinet repainting, electrical and plumbing work, venting, demolition, light optimization, new flooring, baseboards, drywall repair, painting, popcorn ceiling removal, wall modifications, and passing all required city inspections. Older Metro Vancouver homes may also need our [Poly-B Pipe Replacement](/en/services/poly-b-replacement/) service to eliminate unsafe plastic piping. This full-scope approach is typical of a complete Vancouver kitchen overhaul — a kitchen that has been used for 20+ years requires attention to every system and surface, not just the visible cabinetry and countertops. The budget for a full-scope Vancouver kitchen renovation in the mid-range falls between $28,000–$45,000.


