alt="Bathroom Renovation with Custom Glass Door - Before 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mn6jjxj1f5721fde-4.jpg" alt="Bathroom Renovation with Custom Glass Door - After 2"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mn6jjxj1f5721fde-5.jpg" alt="Bathroom Renovation with Custom Glass Door - Before 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/reno-stars/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mn6jjxj1f5721fde-6.jpg" alt="Bathroom Renovation with Custom Glass Door - After 3"></div><h2>Results & Key Takeaways</h2><p>The final result is a stylish and functional bathroom that meets the family''s needs. The sleek design with custom glass doors and black fixtures creates a modern aesthetic, while the mosaic floor tiles add a touch of elegance. The homeowner was extremely satisfied with the quick turnaround and the quality of workmanship. This project highlights the importance of careful planning and quality materials in achieving a successful renovation.</p><p>📊 <strong>How does this compare?</strong> See <a href="/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/">average bathroom renovation costs across Vancouver</a> for 2026 pricing by scope and city.</p>



For homeowners planning for the future or needing improved mobility, our [accessible bathroom renovations](/services/accessible-bathroom/) service includes grab bars, walk-in showers, wider doorways, and slip-resistant flooring.


