| Kusina mid-range | $55,000 | $38,000–$48,000 | 69–87% |
| Pangunahing banyo | $30,000 | $20,000–$26,000 | 67–87% |
| Basement suite | $85,000 | $90,000–$130,000 | 106–153% |
| Poly-B na kapalit | $12,000 | $12,000–$20,000 | 100–167% |
