### What was the scope and budget of this Metrotown toy store renovation?
This Metrotown commercial retail renovation was completed within a budget of $23,000–$25,000 and a timeline of 2–3 weeks. The scope focused on the physical environment: wall modifications to reconfigure the retail floor plan, complete painting of all surfaces to create a fresh brand-consistent backdrop, and laminate flooring installation throughout the store. This wall-paint-flooring focused scope represents the core of a retail refresh that transforms the customer environment without requiring new fixtures or equipment procurement — a cost-effective approach when the existing layout and millwork are functionally sound but visually dated.


