### What was the specific scope and budget of this dual bathroom and powder room renovation?
This family townhouse renovation covered two full bathrooms and a powder room within a $33,000–$35,000 budget over 6–8 weeks. See our guide to [BC Strata Renovation Rules](/en/blog/strata-renovation-rules-vancouver/) for Metro Vancouver homeowners. The first bathroom was converted from a traditional bathtub to a modern walk-in shower enclosure. Our [Accessible Bathroom Renovation](/en/services/accessible-bathroom/) service specialises in safety upgrades and accessibility modifications. The second bathroom received a stylish upgrade to its existing shower configuration. The powder room was designed as a distinctive accent space — a deliberately different aesthetic from the two main bathrooms, creating a memorable design element for guests while maintaining a cohesive overall palette throughout the home. Fixed-price contracts locked in the budget at signing, with no surprise costs during construction.


