/p><h2>Bago at Pagkatapos</h2><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-1-mmmoadov.jpg" alt="Dual Bathroom Renovation with Unique Powder Room - Before Renovation 1"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-1-mmmoadov.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a glass shower enclosure and sleek toilet on gray tiled floor."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-2-mmmoadz5.jpg" alt="Dual Bathroom Renovation with Unique Powder Room - Before Renovation 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mmmoadz5.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a sleek toilet, wooden vanity, and illuminated mirror."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mmmoadz5.jpg" alt="Dual Bathroom Renovation with Unique Powder Room - Before Renovation 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mmmoaea2.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a round mirror, sleek faucet, and glass shower enclosure."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-4-mmmoaea2.jpg" alt="Dual Bathroom Renovation with Unique Powder Room - Before Renovation 4"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-4-mmmoaea3.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a sleek vanity, oval mirror, and stylish gray tiles."></div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-5-mmmoaekh.jpg" alt="Close-up of herringbone and vertical striped wall tiles in a modern renovation."><h2>Mga Resulta at Pangunahing Takeaway</h2><p>Ang pagsasaayos ay nagresulta sa dalawang moderno, functional na banyo at isang natatanging powder room na lumampas sa inaasahan ng kliyente. Tuwang-tuwa ang pamilya sa magkakaugnay na disenyo at sa praktikal ngunit naka-istilong pag-upgrade. Itinatampok ng proyektong ito ang kahalagahan ng pagbabalanse ng functionality sa mga aesthetics sa mga tahanan ng pamilya, na tinitiyak na ang mga espasyo ay parehong maganda at praktikal para sa pang-araw-araw na paggamit.</p>



