UPDATE blog_posts SET content_en = '<h2>Introduction</h2><p>In the heart of [Delta](/en/areas/delta/), BC, a family townhouse underwent a remarkable transformation with the renovation of three and a half bathrooms. This project not only enhanced the functionality of the space but also brought a modern aesthetic to the home.</p><h2>Project Overview</h2><p>The renovation project involved a complete overhaul of three and a half bathrooms. The main bathroom was equipped with both a shower and a bathtub, while the kids'' bathroom featured a bathtub. Additionally, the basement bathroom and a powder room were updated with warm-toned tiles and matte black fixtures. The project was completed within a budget of $40,000 - $43,000 and took approximately 6-8 weeks.</p><h2>Challenges</h2><p>One of the main challenges was coordinating the renovation of multiple bathrooms simultaneously while ensuring minimal disruption to the family. This required careful planning and execution to maintain the household''s daily routine.</p><h2>Our Solution</h2><p>We implemented a phased approach to the renovation, allowing us to complete one bathroom at a time while the family used the others. This strategy minimized inconvenience and ensured a smooth workflow. Our team handled cabinet installation, countertop replacement, backsplash tiling, plumbing, and lighting with precision and care.</p><h2>Before & After</h2><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-1-mmmnqlc8.jpg" alt="Three and a Half [Bathroom Renovation](/en/services/bathroom/) in Delta - Before Renovation 1"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-1-mmmnqlc9.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a wooden vanity, mirror, and sleek fixtures."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-2-mmmnqln8.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mmmnqln9.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a glass shower, freestanding tub, and sleek black fixtures."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mmmnqln9.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mmmnqlzh.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom with wooden vanity, two mirrors, and stylish lighting."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-4-mmmnqlzi.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 4"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-4-mmmnqlzi.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a wooden vanity, round mirror, and festive wreath decoration."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-5-mmmnqm9u.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 5"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-5-mmmnqm9v.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a wooden vanity, white toilet, and large mirror with stylish lighting."></div><h2>Results & Key Takeaways</h2><p>The final outcome was a set of beautifully renovated bathrooms that combined functionality with modern design. The client was thrilled with the results, noting the seamless integration of style and practicality. This project highlighted the importance of strategic planning and phased execution in minimizing disruption during home renovations.</p>



Many Metro Vancouver homeowners also upgrade to a [heat pump HVAC system](/services/heat-pump-hvac/) during renovations — providing efficient year-round heating and cooling while qualifying for CleanBC rebates.


