0fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-2-mmmnqln8.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mmmnqln9.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a glass shower, freestanding tub, and sleek black fixtures."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mmmnqln9.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mmmnqlzh.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom with wooden vanity, two mirrors, and stylish lighting."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-4-mmmnqlzi.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 4"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-4-mmmnqlzi.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a wooden vanity, round mirror, and festive wreath decoration."></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-5-mmmnqm9u.jpg" alt="Three and a Half Bathroom Renovation in Delta - Before Renovation 5"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-5-mmmnqm9v.jpg" alt="Modern bathroom featuring a wooden vanity, white toilet, and large mirror with stylish lighting."></div><h2>Results & Key Takeaways</h2><p>The final outcome was a set of beautifully renovated bathrooms that combined functionality with modern design. The client was thrilled with the results, noting the seamless integration of style and practicality. This project highlighted the importance of strategic planning and phased execution in minimizing disruption during home renovations.</p>



Many Metro Vancouver homeowners also upgrade to a [heat pump HVAC system](/services/heat-pump-hvac/) during renovations — providing efficient year-round heating and cooling while qualifying for CleanBC rebates.


