### How do I verify a BC renovation contractor''s licence number is current?

BC Residential Builders — companies that act as general contractor on projects over $10,000 — must hold a BC Housing Licence. To verify: go to bchousing.org/owner-builder, click ''Find a Licensed Builder'', and search by company name or licence number. Verify the licence status shows Active (not Expired or Suspended) and check the licence expiry date. For subcontractors (plumbers, electricians, HVAC), verify their trade certification at Technical Safety BC (electricians, gas fitters) or through the SkilledTradesBC registry. Consider our [Heat Pump Installation Vancouver](/en/services/heat-pump-hvac/) service to upgrade heating and cooling with modern energy-efficient systems.

