## How Much Does Bathroom Tiling Cost in Vancouver?

Based on our 2026 projects across Metro Vancouver:

| Project Scope | Typical Tile Cost | Total Project Range |
|-' || '-' || '-|-' || '-' || '-|-' || '-' || '-|
| Shower retile only | $1,500–$3,500 | $5,000–$8,000 |
| Full bathroom floor + walls | $3,000–$7,000 | $14,000–$25,000 |
| Luxury full bathroom | $5,000–$12,000 | $28,000–$45,000 |
| Two-bathroom package | $5,000–$10,000 | $26,000–$35,000 |

Tile typically represents 15–25% of your total [bathroom renovation budget](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/). Labour for installation is a significant cost — expect $5–$10/sq ft for standard layouts and $8–$15/sq ft for complex patterns like herringbone or chevron.

For a detailed cost breakdown, see our [bathroom renovation cost guide for Vancouver](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/) or our [Richmond-specific bathroom cost guide](/en/blog/bathroom-renovation-cost-richmond-bc-2026/).

