| Recaulk | Yes | Never necessary to hire — 1-hour DIY |
| Full regrout | Partial | Hire for shower walls/floor — messy and slow |
| Vanity swap (no plumbing relocation) | Partial | Hire if you''ve never sweated copper or used PEX |
