v/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-2-mmo1mbw2.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors - Before Renovation 2"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-2-mmo1mbw2.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors in Richmond - After Renovation 2"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-3-mmo1mbw2.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors - Before Renovation 3"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-3-mmo1mbw3.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors in Richmond - After Renovation 3"></div><div><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-before-4-mmo1mbw3.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors - Before Renovation 4"><img src="https://pub-b88db8c50fd64a9a87f60a4486a4a488.r2.dev/uploads/admin/social-ready-after-4-mmo1mbw3.jpg" alt="Two Bathroom Renovation with Arched Doors in Richmond - After Renovation 4"></div><h2>Results & Key Takeaways</h2><p>The final outcome was a set of beautifully renovated bathrooms and a kitchen that exuded warmth and simplicity. The client was delighted with the seamless integration of the new features, particularly the arched doors, which added a touch of elegance to the home. This project highlights the importance of careful planning and material selection in achieving a harmonious design.</p>



For homeowners planning for the future or needing improved mobility, our [accessible bathroom renovations](/services/accessible-bathroom/) service includes grab bars, walk-in showers, wider doorways, and slip-resistant flooring.


Many Metro Vancouver homeowners also upgrade to a [heat pump HVAC system](/services/heat-pump-hvac/) during renovations — providing efficient year-round heating and cooling while qualifying for CleanBC rebates.


Renovations that add high-draw appliances or modern lighting often benefit from a [critical load panel upgrade](/services/critical-load-panel/) to ensure adequate electrical capacity and safety.


If you live in a strata property (condo or townhouse), review BC''s [strata renovation rules](/blog/strata-renovation-rules-vancouver/) before starting work — many projects require strata council approval and must follow specific noise, hour, and contractor requirements.
