Related services: [Bathroom Renovation](/en/services/bathroom/) | [Whole-House Renovation](/en/services/whole-house/)

Related cost guide: [Bathroom Renovation Cost Vancouver 2026](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/)

Also see: [Tub vs shower: which adds more value](/en/blog/tub-vs-shower-vancouver-which-adds-more-value/) | [Average bathroom renovation cost Vancouver](/en/guides/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/) | [Vancouver Bathroom Renovation](/en/blog/average-bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver/) | [Bathroom Renovation by Style](/en/blog/bathroom-renovation-cost-vancouver-by-style/) | [How to Finance Your Vancouver Renovation (HELOC Guide)](/en/blog/renovation-financing-vancouver-heloc/) | [Renovation Financing Options](/en/financing/) | [Shower Renovation Cost Vancouver 2026](/en/blog/shower-renovation-cost-vancouver-2026/) | [Bathtub Renovation Cost Vancouver](/en/blog/bathtub-renovation-cost-vancouver/) | [Kitchen Renovation Vancouver](/en/services/kitchen/) | [Cabinet Refinishing](/en/services/cabinet/) | [Pre-Sale Renovation Advice](/en/services/realtor/) | [BC Renovation Permits Guide](/en/blog/renovation-permits-bc-guide/) | [Vancouver Renovation Cost Guide 2026](/en/blog/renovation-cost-vancouver-2026-complete-guide/) | [How to Choose a Contractor](/en/blog/how-to-choose-renovation-contractor-vancouver/) | [Renovation Timeline Guide](/en/blog/renovation-timeline-how-long-does-each-project-take/) | [Basement Renovation Vancouver](/en/services/basement/)

### What was the total scope and budget for converting this bathroom into two spaces?
This renovation converted one existing bathroom into two separate functional spaces with a total project budget of $57,000–$60,000 and a timeline of 9–11 weeks. The broader scope beyond the splitting itself included: cabinet installation in both new spaces, countertop replacement, backsplash tiling, plumbing work (required to add an additional sink and potentially relocate the shower), and lighting upgrades. The 9–11 week timeline reflects the structural complexity of the split — new walls, plumbing rough-in for both spaces, and full finishing of two complete bathroom environments rather than one. Older Metro Vancouver homes may also need our [Poly-B Pipe Replacement](/en/services/poly-b-replacement/) service to eliminate unsafe plastic piping.


