### What was the specific scope and budget of the daughter''s bathroom in this Richmond renovation?
The daughter''s bathroom renovation within this Richmond whole-house project had a specific budget of $17,000–$20,000 and was completed in 4–5 weeks. The transformation converted an outdated bathtub into a modern shower featuring gray tiles, matte black fixtures, a frameless glass door, and a miter cut niche for recessed storage. Phasing a bathroom renovation within a larger whole-house project can reduce mobilization and scheduling costs compared to completing the bathroom as a standalone later project — trades are already on-site, staging areas are established, and design coordination is unified across all spaces.


