### What was the complete scope of this minimalist Richmond whole house renovation?
This Richmond whole house renovation was completed within a $60,000–$63,000 budget over 7–9 weeks. The project centred on two areas: the kitchen renovation (creating a minimalist warm aesthetic with clean lines and warm material tones) and the bathroom renovation (designed to complement the kitchen''s minimalist character). The minimalist warm style — as opposed to a cold Scandinavian minimalism — uses natural wood tones, warm whites, and organic textures to create a paired-down space that still feels inviting. This design philosophy requires restraint in material selection to achieve the refined result.


