## Frequently Asked Questions

**How much does a kitchen renovation cost in Richmond BC in 2026?**
Budget kitchen renovations in Richmond range from $16,000–$28,000. Mid-range full replacements cost $28,000–$48,000. High-end custom kitchens run $48,000–$85,000+. Luxury custom kitchens in Seafair or Quilchena can exceed $100,000.

**Does my Richmond condo kitchen renovation need strata approval?**
Yes — virtually all strata kitchen renovations in Richmond require written council approval. This includes work affecting plumbing, electrical, or any penetrations of common property (walls, floors, ceilings). Allow 4–8 weeks for approval. Reno Stars prepares the complete application package.

**How long does a kitchen renovation take in Richmond?**
