Also see: [Social-ready kitchen renovation #1](/en/blog/social-ready-kitchen-renovation-case-study/) | [Exotic waterfall island kitchen](/en/blog/exotic-style-kitchen-renovation-with-waterfall-island/) | [social-ready kitchen case study #2](/en/blog/social-ready-kitchen-renovation-case-study-2/) | [How to Choose a Contractor](/en/blog/how-to-choose-renovation-contractor-vancouver/) | [Pre-Sale Renovation Advice](/en/services/realtor/) | [BC Renovation Permits Guide](/en/blog/renovation-permits-bc-guide/) | [Renovation Timeline Guide](/en/blog/renovation-timeline-how-long-does-each-project-take/) | [Vancouver Renovation Cost Guide 2026](/en/blog/renovation-cost-vancouver-2026-complete-guide/) | [How to Finance Your Vancouver Renovation (HELOC Guide)](/en/blog/renovation-financing-vancouver-heloc/) | [Renovation Financing Options](/en/financing/) | [Kitchen Design Trends Vancouver 2026](/en/blog/kitchen-design-trends-vancouver-2026/) | [Kitchen Layout Planning Vancouver](/en/blog/kitchen-layout-planning-vancouver-2026/) | [Quartz vs Granite Countertops Vancouver](/en/blog/quartz-vs-granite-countertops-vancouver-2026/) | [Vancouver Home Renovation Guide](/en/blog/vancouver-home-renovation-guide-2026/) | [Bathroom Renovation Vancouver](/en/services/bathroom/) | [Whole-House Renovation Vancouver](/en/services/whole-house/) | [Basement Renovation Vancouver](/en/services/basement/vancouver/)

### What was the full scope of work in this Vancouver social kitchen renovation?
This Vancouver social kitchen renovation was among the most comprehensive in scope, covering: prefab and customized cabinet installation, finger pull design, space optimization, cabinet repainting, electrical and plumbing work, venting installation, demolition, light optimization, new flooring, baseboards, drywall repair, painting, popcorn ceiling removal, wall changes, and obtaining city inspection sign-off. Older Metro Vancouver homes may also need our [Poly-B Pipe Replacement](/en/services/poly-b-replacement/) service to eliminate unsafe plastic piping. The comprehensive scope reflects the nature of a true social kitchen transformation — achieving an open, functional result requires addressing every surface and system simultaneously rather than phasing individual elements. A $35,000–$55,000 social kitchen renovation budget accommodates this full-scope approach.


