### High-End Kitchen Renovation: $44,000–$75,000

For Heritage Mountain view homes or larger Klahanie properties:

- Custom cabinetry: $20,000–$36,000
- Stone countertops: $7,000–$14,000
- Professional appliances: $9,000–$19,000
- Heated floors: $2,000–$4,500
