| [Wood Veins Custom, Burnaby](/en/projects/custom-kitchen-renovation-black-fixtures-burnaby) | $30K–$35K | Insert behind matching veneer hood box 36" 900 CFM | **~$2,180** |
| [Modern Quartz Kitchen, Langley](/en/projects/modern-kitchen-renovation-langley-2) | $32K–$35K | Wall-mount chimney 36" 900 CFM | **~$1,560** |
| [Gold Fixtures Custom, Burnaby](/en/projects/custom-kitchen-renovation-burnaby) | $35K–$40K | Insert behind painted custom hood box 36" 1,000 CFM + makeup air | **~$3,240** |
| [Modern Custom Cabinets, Surrey](/en/projects/modern-kitchen-renovation-surrey) | $35K–$38K | Wall-mount 36" 900 CFM premium stainless | **~$2,150** |
