| [Cuisine moderne, Richmond](/en/projects/modern-kitchen-renovation-richmond) | $20K–$24K | Sous-armoire 30" 400 CFM canalisé | **~$580** (conduit existant réutilisé) |
| [Bois minimaliste + quartz, Richmond](/en/projects/minimalist-kitchen-renovation-richmond) | $22K–$25K | Cheminée mince 30" 600 CFM | **~$840** |
| [Cuisine économique de Coquitlam](/en/projects/kitchen-renovation-coquitlam) | $25K–$27K | Sous-armoire 30" Nouveau conduit 400 CFM | **~$680** (nouveau conduit court) |
| [Surrey Cuisine Reno](/en/projects/kitchen-renovation-surrey) | $25K–$30K | Cheminée murale 30" 600 CFM | **~$1,150** |
