| [Île Waterfall, Langley](/en/projects/langley-kitchen-renovation-waterfall-island-design) | $28K–$30K | Cheminée murale 36" 700 CFM | **~$1,420** |
| [Cuisine blanc + or, West Van](/en/projects/kitchen-renovation-west-vancouver) | $29K–$33K | Support mural mince 30" 600 CFM en acier inoxydable | **~$1,290** |
| [Veins de bois personnalisés, Burnaby](/en/projects/custom-kitchen-renovation-black-fixtures-burnaby) | $30K–$35K | Insérer derrière la boîte de hotte en placage assortie 36" 900 CFM | **~$2,180** |
| [Cuisine moderne en quartz, Langley](/en/projects/modern-kitchen-renovation-langley-2) | $32K–$35K | Cheminée murale 36" 900 CFM | **~$1,560** |
