Staying 5+ years: full replacement gives you soft-close drawers, full-height pantry organization, and a modern layout for a decade. Under 2 years: painting or refacing is the right call. See our [pre-sale renovation guide](/en/blog/pre-sale-renovation-vancouver-what-to-fix-before-listing/) and [renovate-vs-move guide](/en/blog/renovate-vs-move-vancouver-2026/).



Metro Vancouver homeowners increasingly include a [heat pump HVAC upgrade](/services/heat-pump-hvac/) in their renovation plans — these systems provide efficient heating and cooling year-round, and qualify for BC Hydro and CleanBC rebate programs.


For homeowners planning long-term or accommodating family members with mobility needs, [accessible bathroom renovations](/services/accessible-bathroom/) — including grab bars, curbless showers, and slip-resistant flooring — are a smart addition to any major renovation project.
## Frequently Asked Questions

### Can oak cabinets be painted white in Langley?
Yes, but oak has prominent grain that shows through a single paint coat. For a smooth white finish, we add grain filler and an extra primer coat (+$500–$800 on a standard painting quote). Or skip the extra step for a subtle wood-grain look under the white — still very popular in 2026 for farmhouse kitchens.

### Does cabinet refacing make sense in Willoughby shaker kitchens?
Usually no — Willoughby shaker doors are already the style most homeowners want; refacing doesn''t add visual impact. Painting to a lighter colour is the high-ROI move. Refacing makes sense only if the doors themselves are damaged or if you want soft-close hinges and new hardware.

### How long does painting vs refacing take in Langley?
Painting: 5–7 days on-site (we spray the doors in our shop). Refacing: 1–2 weeks on-site (doors take 2–3 weeks to order, then 2–3 days install). Full replacement: 3–6 weeks on-site. You''ll "camp" with fridge + microwave + essentials tote during the work.

### Do you do permits in Langley?
No permit needed for painting or refacing. Full replacement that moves plumbing (sink relocation) or electrical (new range circuit) needs plumbing and/or electrical permits from the Township of Langley or City of Langley — we pull them for you. Older Metro Vancouver homes may also need our [Poly-B Pipe Replacement](/en/services/poly-b-replacement/) service to eliminate unsafe plastic piping. See our [BC renovation permits guide](/en/blog/renovation-permits-bc-guide/) | [Vancouver Renovation Cost Guide 2026](/en/blog/renovation-cost-vancouver-2026-complete-guide/) | [How to Choose a Contractor](/en/blog/how-to-choose-renovation-contractor-vancouver/) | [Pre-Sale Renovation Advice](/en/services/realtor/) | [Renovation Timeline Guide](/en/blog/renovation-timeline-how-long-does-each-project-take/).

### Do you serve Surrey and Abbotsford too?
Yes — we cover Surrey, White Rock, and Abbotsford at Langley pricing. No travel surcharge within the Fraser Valley.

### Do you have a dedicated guide for other cities?
Yes. See our guides for [Vancouver cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-vancouver-cost-guide/), [Burnaby cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-burnaby-cost-guide/), [Richmond cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-richmond-cost-guide/), [Surrey cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-surrey-cost-guide/), [Coquitlam cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-coquitlam-cost-guide/), [Port Coquitlam cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-port-coquitlam-cost-guide/), [Delta cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-delta-cost-guide/), [New Westminster cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-new-westminster-cost-guide/), [North Vancouver cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-north-vancouver-cost-guide/), [West Vancouver cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-west-vancouver-cost-guide/), [White Rock cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-white-rock-cost-guide/), [Maple Ridge cabinet refinishing](/en/blog/cabinet-refinishing-maple-ridge-cost-guide/), and [Port Moody cabinet resurfacing](/en/blog/cabinet-resurfacing-port-moody-cost-guide/).

