<h3>2. Recreation Room o Family Space</h3>
<p>Built-in na shelving, wet bar, home theater wiring, at dekalidad na LVP o engineered hardwood flooring. Mataas na ROI para sa [Burnaby](/en/areas/burnaby/), [Surrey](/en/areas/surrey/), at [Coquitlam](/en/areas/coquitlam/) pamilya.</p>
