<p>Sound insulation, upgraded lighting, ethernet rough-in, at hiwalay na pasukan kung posible. BC Building Code pinakamababang taas ng kisame: <strong>6 talampakan 5 pulgada (1.95 m)</strong>.</p>
<h3>4. Legal na Pangalawang Suite</h3>
<p>Ang mortgage helper. Nangangailangan ng hiwalay na pasukan, full kitchen, banyo, egress window, fire separation, at electrical panel ng nangungupahan. Bumubuo ang mga legal suite ng Metro Vancouver <strong>$1,800 hanggang $2,800 bawat buwan</strong> sa kita sa upa.</p>
<h3>5. Marangyang Basement Tapos</h3>
<p>Mga wine cellar, home gym, spa bathroom, at custom na sinehan sa [West Vancouver](/en/areas/west-vancouver/), Coal Harbour, at Shaughnessy. Kinakailangan ang mga premium na finish at espesyal na mekanikal na sistema.</p>
