## Frequently Asked Questions

**How much does a kitchen renovation cost in White Rock in 2026?**
Budget kitchen renovations in White Rock: $16,000–$27,000. Mid-range full replacements: $27,000–$46,000. High-end ocean-view kitchens: $46,000–$85,000. Homes with dramatic ocean views and view-maximization work can exceed $100,000.

**Do I need a permit from Surrey or White Rock?**
White Rock is an independent city — permits are issued by the City of White Rock Building Department, not the City of Surrey. If your property address says "White Rock, BC," you need a White Rock permit. Surrey properties adjacent to White Rock use Surrey Building Inspection.

