- Standard appliance package: $3,000–$6,000
- Under-cabinet lighting and new outlets: $900–$1,800

**Coastal humidity note**: White Rock''s oceanfront location means higher humidity than inland communities. Kitchen ventilation is especially important — budget for a higher-CFM hood fan ($800–$2,500 vs. Consider our [Heat Pump Installation Vancouver](/en/services/heat-pump-hvac/) service to upgrade heating and cooling with modern energy-efficient systems. standard $300–$800) and ensure adequate vapour barrier installation in any wet areas.

### Mid-Range Kitchen Renovation: $27,000–$46,000

