<p>We''ve completed projects across South Surrey, Newton, Fleetwood, and Cloverdale — including a <a href="/en/projects/two-bathroom-renovation-modern-style-surrey/">dual bathroom renovation ($28K–$32K)</a> and <a href="/en/projects/kitchen-renovation-custom-cabinets-surrey/">custom cabinet kitchen ($29K–$31K)</a>. Our [cabinet refinishing](/en/services/cabinet/) service can transform your cabinets without full replacement. <a href="/en/services/basement/surrey/">Explore our basement renovation service in Surrey →</a></p>
<h2>What Surrey Homeowners Should Know</h2>
<h3>1. Waterproofing comes first</h3>
<p>Surrey''s Fraser Valley clay soils and seasonal groundwater require proper drainage before any framing. Skipping this causes mould and failed finishes within 3–5 years.</p>
<h3>2. Rental income is strong</h3>
<p>A legal 1-bedroom suite rents for $1,400–$1,800/month. At $100,000 renovation cost, you recover your investment in 5–6 years through rent alone.</p>
<h3>3. Best neighbourhoods for ROI</h3>
<ul><li><strong>Fleetwood/Newton:</strong> 1990s–2000s homes, 900+ sq ft basements — best ROI</li>
<li><strong>Cloverdale:</strong> Often 1,100+ sq ft — larger scope, larger return</li>
<li><strong>South Surrey/White Rock:</strong> Higher budgets, high-value candidates</li></ul>
<h2>Timeline</h2>
<ul><li>Permit: 4–6 weeks</li><li>Construction: 6–10 weeks</li><li><strong>Total: 10–16 weeks from signed contract</strong></li></ul>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<h3>Can I build a legal suite in Surrey?</h3>
<p>Yes. Surrey has an active secondary suite program meeting BC Building Code. We handle all permits and inspections.</p>
<h3>How much does a legal suite add to Surrey home value?</h3>
<p>Typically $80,000–$150,000 in resale value based on recent comparable sales. See our <a href="/en/guides/basement-suite-cost-vancouver/">basement suite cost guide</a> for more detail.</p>
See our [verified five-star reviews](/en/reviews/) from Metro Vancouver homeowners.

