UPDATE blog_posts SET content_en = '<h2>How Much Does a Bathroom Renovation Cost in Vancouver?</h2>
<p>Whether you are updating a condo powder room or fully gutting a house bathroom, cost is the first question homeowners ask. Based on real projects completed by Reno Stars across Metro Vancouver in 2025–2026, here is what to budget.</p>
<p><strong>Average bathroom renovation cost in Vancouver: $18,000 – $45,000+</strong>, depending on scope, size, and finish level.</p>

<h2>Bathroom Renovation Cost Breakdown by Scope</h2>
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Scope</th><th>Typical Cost</th><th>What''s Included</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Cosmetic refresh</td><td>$8,000 – $15,000</td><td>New vanity, fixtures, paint, mirror. No layout changes.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Standard renovation</td><td>$18,000 – $25,000</td><td>New tile, vanity, shower/tub, fixtures, lighting. Minor plumbing moves.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mid-range remodel</td><td>$25,000 – $35,000</td><td>Custom cabinetry, frameless glass, heated floors, layout changes.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Luxury / curbless</td><td>$35,000 – $45,000+</td><td>Curbless shower, premium tile, custom features, full plumbing rework.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Multi-bathroom</td><td>$26,000 – $43,000</td><td>Two or more bathrooms done simultaneously (cost savings per unit).</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h2>Real Bathroom Renovation Projects &amp; Costs</h2>
<p>These are actual completed projects — not estimates or national averages.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="/en/areas/maple-ridge/">Maple Ridge</a> — Custom Glass Door Bathroom:</strong> $18,000 – $21,000. Completed in 3–4 weeks. Included custom frameless glass shower door, new tile, and modern vanity.</li>
