<h3>Permits &amp; Inspections</h3>
<p>Most Metro Vancouver municipalities require permits for plumbing and electrical changes. Budget $500–$1,500 for permits. Cities like Vancouver, Burnaby, and North Vancouver have slightly different permit requirements — your contractor should handle this.</p>
<h3>Condo vs. House</h3>
<p>Condo renovations often require strata approval (2–6 week lead time), specific insurance, and work-hour restrictions. These add scheduling complexity but do not significantly change material costs.</p>

