<tbody>
<tr><td>Budget</td><td>$10K – $15K</td><td>Surface refresh: tile shower wall, vanity swap, fixtures, pintura</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mid-range</td><td>$15K – $20K</td><td>Pag-convert ng tub-to-shower o shower-to-tub, frameless glass na pinto, semi-custom na vanity</td></tr>
<tr><td>High-end</td><td>$20K – $25K+</td><td>Curbless shower na may linear drain, niche, bangko, premium na tile, custom na vanity</td></tr>
