<tr><td>Mid-range</td><td>$25K – $35K</td><td>Semi-custom na vanity, frameless glass shower, soaker tub, designer tile</td></tr>
<tr><td>High-end</td><td>$35K – $45K+</td><td>Custom millwork double vanity, curbless walk-in shower, freestanding tub, full-height na tile</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<h3>5 pirasong luxury master — $30,000 to $60,000+</h3>
<table>
